OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to halt Glass Centre
OL,4,Ademolition inches closer
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to save the National Glass Centre
OL,7,F(NGC) have inched forward with the
OL,8,Flocal council backing a move which
OL,9,Fcould eventually force the building's
OL,10,Fowner to seek planning permission to
OL,11,Fdemolish it.
OL,13,FSunderland City Council's Reform-led
OL,14,Fcabinet issued an Article 4 direction
OL,15,Fwhich it said "paves the way for
OL,16,Ffurther consideration" of the
OL,17,FUniversity of Sunderland's wish to
OL,18,Fknock down the centre.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
