OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to halt Glass Centre
OL,4,Ademolition inches closer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe next stage will see notice served
OL,7,Fon the university and a period of 21
OL,8,Fdays for "third parties to make
OL,9,Frepresentations" ahead of a final
OL,10,Fdecision in December on whether to
OL,11,Fimplement planning requirements.
OL,13,FThe university has been approached for
OL,14,Fcomment.
